  "details": "As the main menu has gotten more complex, it has become more tedious to swap \"profiles\" for settings between use cases.  \n\nExamples of separate uses that need different settings:  \"Big event\" -- put on earmuffs, set distance hider, change safety settings.\n\n\"Streamer\" -- use stream mode, smooth camera, hide nameplates, adjust safety, possibly enable snap turn\n\nSuggestion is to allow for some form of settings profiles, as well as exporting/importing settings to share with other users or to sync across different computers.",
